OL,3,AHarry Potter and the goblet of no booze
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe bid was turned down by Cannock
OL,6,FChase District Council which received
OL,7,Fmore than 75 objections, plus the jibe
OL,8,F- during a licensing hearing - from a
OL,9,FReform UK councillor.
OL,11,FThe applicant had told the hearing that
OL,12,Fit would ensure there was no adverse
OL,13,Fimpact for neighbours.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
